OL,3,GNEWSAWigan Council 'listening' as
OL,4,Awarehouse plans dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA consultation is due to end on Wigan
OL,7,FCouncil's plan for future development,
OL,8,Fwith four sites potentially earmarked
OL,9,Ffor warehouses being removed.
OL,11,FIt follows an outcry from residents
OL,12,Fover the construction of huge
OL,13,Fwarehouses close to homes near Astley.
OL,15,FThe local authority said it had
OL,16,Flistened and "struck the right balance
OL,17,Fbetween supporting economic growth and
OL,18,Fjob creation".
OL,20,FGreenbelt campaigners and opposition
OL,21,Fcouncillors claimed they had forced the
OL,22,Fcouncil to act.
